p in the serving-stack build pipelines, covering both KServe and Platform Operator builds.\n45\t- The check passes on the FIPS-remediated serving-stack images (no false positives on the remediated state).\n46\t\n47\t## HLR Traceability\n48\t\n49\t- HLR-3 (primary): \"CI enforces FIPS regressions: a gating check fails any serving-stack build that reintroduces non-validated crypto usage.\"\n50\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a488ada2fd1a9b9e","agent_id":"af6c989a891c2acf9","session_id":"29cb84a9-828d-4dcd-a97c-1ceca07010da","uuid":"4b3f508c-0192-4bb2-b96f-063367eeeb4f","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:59:15.580Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8c19760f083b0e75","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9013 decomposition"}
